      ],
      "content": "SP 90 NW             BUCKLAND                 DANCERS END 12/62                                         Boundary wall and railings                                               to S. & E. of Dancers End House GV                                            II Boundary wall and railings. C18. Red brick with blue headers. Moulded plinth and ogee moulded coping bricks. Curved corner to S.E.;section of cast iron railings in front of main E. elevation of house: Brick dwarf wall with stone coping, spearhead railings, central gate of matching pattern with similar posts. Modern wooden gate and piers at S. end. Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP9052209917"
